      "message": "refactor(ui): viewport handle and pick inks are theme tokens\n\nThe move and turn handles drew their shadow and readout with colour\nliterals, and a picked point drew its rim with one. Three tokens now\ncarry them: handle_shade, handle_text and pick_rim. Each is a theme-file\ncolour key. Both built-in tables keep the old values, so no pixel\nchanges. The colour-literal guard loses three rows.\n\ngeom_legal moves unchanged from theme.rs to theme/legal.rs (400-line\nlaw).\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
